+| `202608270848-V32542` AP-GRANT-CONTINUITY-001   | Absorb      | M1 authority invariants plus M2 recovery adapter                                                 |
+| `202608251038-42AC0D` AP-AUTH-001               | Absorb      | M2 end-to-end authority adapter qualification                                                    |
